{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sheepherds!</i></strong> is a friendly and playful co-op game for up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your sheepdog buddies and guide fluffy flocks through colorful flower fields to dye their wool\u2026and make cool clothes for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and have fun barking, running, and discovering magical places together \u2014 or take on challenges to win treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheep follow and influence each other, just like in real life. Learn to manage them like a good sheepdog, by positioning yourself strategically and barking at just the right moment! Or, just do whatever: after all, you\u2019re a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=580 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A relaxing co-op game for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sheepherds! </strong></i>was designed to be a friendly, relaxing co-op experience. No mandatory task-sharing, no peer pressure, no time limit \u2014 enjoy an experience where your actions can only have positive effects. Stay friends with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your perfect herding pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make sure everyone can enjoy a comfy shepherding adventure, you can freely adjust the game's difficulty between levels. If things ever feel a bit too hectic or you\u2019re still finding your rhythm, don't worry \u2014 tweak the settings and settle into a pace that feels right for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll still earn the same rewards and achievements either way, so whether you're a new pup or an old pro, there's always a way to play that fits you perfectly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2a2c15ff9ae27f3a2304e10a3adfc052.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2a2c15ff9ae27f3a2304e10a3adfc052.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2a2c15ff9ae27f3a2304e10a3adfc052.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spice it up with optional challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add an extra layer of depth with optional challenges designed to test your skills and teamwork. Will you become the top dog and master every challenge, or are you just looking to vibe with your friends? Either way is okay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not just any dog - <i>your</i> dog</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your well-earned treats into exciting rewards! Unlock a variety of stylish accessories, colorful outfits and unique skins to personalize your sheepdog. Mix and match your favorite combinations to create a look that perfectly reflects your style and makes your dog stand out in the flock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b4d1e9ab910e51d0a32fc3b44517bd4e.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b4d1e9ab910e51d0a32fc3b44517bd4e.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b4d1e9ab910e51d0a32fc3b44517bd4e.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kick back in the big field</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break between two herding trips and enjoy the little things: snap photos with your friends, read the sweet letters from your grandma, or dive into the mini-games she\u2019s prepared just for you. Each new area you unlock brings fresh surprises and joyful moments to share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/4cab31605822797190e9518f5e73ed04.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/4cab31605822797190e9518f5e73ed04.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/4cab31605822797190e9518f5e73ed04.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Pups!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 18 adorable dog breeds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/274a6bad502115adacd7470d37dc6acc.avif?t=1773124271\" width=1080 height=608 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wool Run!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/e9df43769e083cc583dc04211942decebff82b8c.jpg"},{"name":"Seen it all","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/99556f7f3daeccac61216de9964293e2994990f5.jpg"},{"name":"Solve a case","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/871891d1fc6511af1728ba2e742f1e81331db249.jpg"},{"name":"Piracy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/2a7d7b61c8a5337d3623fa7c094d6d2a5af814a3.jpg"},{"name":"Under cover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/13acc4fea5b857b03ed77dc3de9d64556c3ff49e.jpg"},{"name":"Double bubble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/036ff0ae0dc44adb707750f21a9db75877b2e4e5.jpg"},{"name":"Penitent dog will pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/2c02a05fdc1a8da6d4378a7b8d8c259dbeb30d5d.jpg"},{"name":"France 98","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/59c6d51610a3c02318a127d145afaa6db89b6172.jpg"},{"name":"Mole control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/5b527a476ed9d5feeda73888831f71b3a4f7869d.jpg"},{"name":"Blind barker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3006280/786686f7df872b0e83ab4f0a696029de6db2ad3b.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3006280?t=1773124271","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773124271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/2300445f3a8ddf406429a07986bef4096f301bf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773124271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/2300445f3a8ddf406429a07986bef4096f301bf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773124271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord (QR code below or link on the right) to share your thoughts and find your fellow shepherds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2bb093914db9f721bdb1df7125110345.avif?t=1773124271\" width=1000 height=250 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sheepherds!</i></strong> is a friendly and playful co-op game for up to four players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your sheepdog buddies and guide fluffy flocks through colorful flower fields to dye their wool\u2026and make cool clothes for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and have fun barking, running, and discovering magical places together \u2014 or take on challenges to win treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the flock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheep follow and influence each other, just like in real life. Learn to manage them like a good sheepdog, by positioning yourself strategically and barking at just the right moment! Or, just do whatever: after all, you\u2019re a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=580 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b8379e054322c1bbb2815ef74d679f19.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A relaxing co-op game for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Sheepherds! </strong></i>was designed to be a friendly, relaxing co-op experience. No mandatory task-sharing, no peer pressure, no time limit \u2014 enjoy an experience where your actions can only have positive effects. Stay friends with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2445faf65b0b83d441518ecf17f30ff7.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find your perfect herding pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make sure everyone can enjoy a comfy shepherding adventure, you can freely adjust the game's difficulty between levels. If things ever feel a bit too hectic or you\u2019re still finding your rhythm, don't worry \u2014 tweak the settings and settle into a pace that feels right for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll still earn the same rewards and achievements either way, so whether you're a new pup or an old pro, there's always a way to play that fits you perfectly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2a2c15ff9ae27f3a2304e10a3adfc052.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2a2c15ff9ae27f3a2304e10a3adfc052.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/2a2c15ff9ae27f3a2304e10a3adfc052.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spice it up with optional challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add an extra layer of depth with optional challenges designed to test your skills and teamwork. Will you become the top dog and master every challenge, or are you just looking to vibe with your friends? Either way is okay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/68fd17259fbdb963865c0380e5de32f2.mp4?t=1773124271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not just any dog - <i>your</i> dog</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your well-earned treats into exciting rewards! Unlock a variety of stylish accessories, colorful outfits and unique skins to personalize your sheepdog. Mix and match your favorite combinations to create a look that perfectly reflects your style and makes your dog stand out in the flock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b4d1e9ab910e51d0a32fc3b44517bd4e.poster.avif?t=1773124271\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006280/extras/b4d1e9ab910e51d0a32fc3b44517bd4e.webm?t=1773124271\" type=\"vi